  "notes": "USAGE: {批判|ひはん} implies a reasoned evaluation with justification, whereas {非難|ひなん} is more about blaming or condemning without necessarily providing reasoning.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {批判|ひはん}する (to criticize)\n- {批判|ひはん}を⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (to receive criticism)\n- {批判|ひはん}を⟦{浴|あ}びる→浴びる：02844_abiru⟧ (to be subjected to criticism)\n- {批判|ひはん}{的|てき} (critical)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{批評|ひひょう}→批評：03581_hihyou⟧ - literary/artistic review or critique\n- ⟦{非難|ひなん}→非難：14616_hinan⟧ - blame, censure (more negative)",
